WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
It is so beyond me that this is controversial at all, but white people should not be using

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.160
the n-word.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.160
Period.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.280
Using the word as a white person I think just shows really intense ignorance, hatred, and

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.500
disrespect and the idea that it's like just a word or not that deep ignores the history

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.000
and power behind language.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.080
Words freaking matter.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:23.780
Every single act of hatred, violence, mass atrocity, whatever it is, it begins with language

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.920
and rhetoric that dehumanizes, divides, and incites violence.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.620
And I fully understand that we're in a time of intense cancel culture and people are exhausted

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.140
of this constant expectation to be politically correct.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:40.140
And there's definitely validity to this frustration, and liberal culture needs to give people room

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.580
to breathe, but I also think that the n-word is an exception to this.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:49.380
The word became a slur during and after the transatlantic slave trade, and it was used

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.860
for centuries to demean, dehumanize, and justify the oppression of black people, and the word

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.580
carries the weight of that history.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.660
of this, I really don't think as a white person it can be used in a humorous context.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:05.420
The word has been reclaimed by black communities as an act of taking back power, which is something

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:09.020
I have immense respect for, but whether or not you agree with that reclaiming of the

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:13.180
word, you have to understand that it's fundamentally different when it's used by a black person.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:18.220
It's also just not that difficult or not that much of an ask to just not say the n-word,

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.580
and I think it just shows respect, especially considering the immense amount of privilege

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:25.970
white people have living a life free of racial prejudice.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:26.970
Just be careful with your words.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:27.970
Remember that they have power.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:28.970
That's all she wrote.

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:28.990
Bye!
